{"docKey":"P4758","code":"\"\"\"\nP4758. 奇偶之选 - 奇偶曼哈顿分类判定\n\n题面要点：把下标按 (1,2), (3,4), … 顺序配对；n 为奇数时最后一只宝箱\n单独成组。要恰好打开 x 个组，且从每个被打开的组里恰好取出一只宝箱，\n问取出的宝石总价值能否为奇数。\n\n输入：第一行 T；每组第一行 n x，第二行 n 个价值。\n输出：每组一行 \"Yes\" / \"No\"。\n\n核心思路（只看奇偶）：\n1. 组分三类——「灵活组」（组内一奇一偶，取哪只都行，贡献奇偶可选）、\n   「奇数组」（怎么取都是奇）、「偶数组」（怎么取都是偶）。\n2. 存在灵活组时必 Yes：它自己让总和的奇偶可自由翻转。\n3. 全是奇/偶组时，设奇数组有 o 个、偶数组有 e 个，凑出恰好 x 组需要\n   选 k 个奇数组：k ∈ [max(0, x−e), min(o, x)]；总和是奇 ⟺ k 为奇数，\n   区间里存在奇数即 Yes。\n\n时间复杂度：每组 O(n)\n空间复杂度：O(1)（边读边数）\n\"\"\"\n\n# https://codefun2000.com/p/P4758\nimport sys\n\n# @sample-start\n\"\"\"\n样例输入 1:\n4\n4 2\n1 2 3 4\n4 2\n1 3 2 4\n4 2\n1 3 5 7\n1 1\n2\n\n样例输出 1:\nYes\nYes\nNo\nNo\n\"\"\"\n# @sample-end\n\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    pos = 0\n    t = int(data[pos])\n    pos += 1\n    out = []\n    for _ in range(t):\n        n, x = int(data[pos]), int(data[pos + 1])\n        pos += 2\n        odd_cnt = even_cnt = mix_cnt = 0\n        for start in range(0, n, 2):\n            p = int(data[pos + start]) & 1\n            q = (int(data[pos + start + 1]) & 1) if start + 1 < n else p\n            # q 复制成与 p 同值时，该单件组的判定走「同奇偶」分支\n            if p != q:\n                mix_cnt += 1\n            elif p:\n                odd_cnt += 1\n            else:\n                even_cnt += 1\n        pos += n\n\n        if mix_cnt > 0:\n            # 灵活组自由翻转奇偶，一定能拼出奇数\n            out.append(\"Yes\")\n        else:\n            # 恰好开 x 组须挑 k 个奇数组：k ∈ [max(0, x−even), min(odd, x)]\n            lo = max(0, x - even_cnt)\n            hi = min(odd_cnt, x)\n            lo_odd = lo | 1          # 不小于 lo 的最小奇数\n            out.append(\"Yes\" if (lo <= hi and lo_odd <= hi) else \"No\")\n    sys.stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(out) + \"\\n\")\n\n\ndef run_tests():\n    \"\"\"官方样例 + 分类边界 + 随机暴力对拍。\"\"\"\n    import io\n\n    test_cases = [\n        # 官方样例（四组合并）\n        (\n            \"4\\n4 2\\n1 2 3 4\\n4 2\\n1 3 2 4\\n4 2\\n1 3 5 7\\n1 1\\n2\\n\",\n            \"Yes\\nYes\\nNo\\nNo\",\n        ),\n        # 有灵活组但 x 超过其它组数量：灵活组反复起作用\n        (\n            \"1\\n6 3\\n1 2 3 4 1 2\\n\",\n            None,  # 下面手动算\n        ),\n        # 全是偶数组且 x 为奇数个组：必 No\n        (\n            \"1\\n4 1\\n2 4 6 8\\n\",\n            \"No\",\n        ),\n        # 全是奇数组且只开 1 组：必 Yes\n        (\n            \"1\\n2 1\\n1 3\\n\",\n            \"Yes\",\n        ),\n        # 全是奇数组开 3 组：k=3 奇 -> Yes\n        (\n            \"1\\n6 3\\n1 3 5 7 9 11\\n\",\n            \"Yes\",\n        ),\n        # 奇数组 2 个 + 偶数组 1 个，x=2：k ∈ [1,2]，k=1 有奇 -> Yes\n        (\n            \"1\\n6 2\\n1 3 2 4 5 7\\n\",\n            \"Yes\",\n        ),\n        # 奇数组 2 个 + 偶数组 0 个，x=4：k 只能 4 -> No\n        (\n            \"1\\n8 4\\n1 3 5 7 9 11 13 15\\n\",\n            \"No\",\n        ),\n        # 0 也是偶数：单件 0 的组是偶组\n        (\n            \"1\\n1 1\\n0\\n\",\n            \"No\",\n        ),\n    ]\n\n    for i, case in enumerate(test_cases, 1):\n        inp, expected = case\n        if expected is None:\n            # 6 3 | 1 2 3 4 1 2：组 (1,2)mix (3,4)mix (1,2)mix，全灵活 -> Yes\n            expected = \"Yes\"\n        old_stdin, old_stdout = sys.stdin, sys.stdout\n        sys.stdin = io.TextIOWrapper(io.BytesIO(inp.encode(\"utf-8\")))\n        sys.stdout = io.StringIO()\n        try:\n            solve()\n            output = sys.stdout.getvalue().strip()\n        finally:\n            sys.stdin, sys.stdout = old_stdin, old_stdout\n\n        status = \"✓\" if output == expected else \"✗\"\n        print(f\"样例 {i}: 期望={expected}, 实际={output} {status}\")\n\n    # 随机暴力对拍：小 n 枚举「开哪些组 + 每组取哪一只」全部方案\n    import itertools\n    import random\n\n    rng = random.Random(20260411)\n    ok = True\n    for case in range(400):\n        n = rng.randint(1, 7)\n        a = [rng.randint(0, 9) for _ in range(n)]\n        x = rng.randint(1, (n + 1) // 2)\n        groups = [a[k:k + 2] for k in range(0, n, 2)]\n        m = len(groups)\n        brute = False\n        for pick in itertools.combinations(range(m), x):\n            combos = [g for g in (groups[k] for k in pick)]\n            for take in itertools.product(*combos):\n                if sum(take) % 2 == 1:\n                    brute = True\n                    break\n            if brute:\n                break\n\n        # 期望逻辑同 solve\n        odd_cnt = even_cnt = mix_cnt = 0\n        for g in groups:\n            parities = {v & 1 for v in g}\n            if len(parities) > 1:\n                mix_cnt += 1\n            elif 1 in parities:\n                odd_cnt += 1\n            else:\n                even_cnt += 1\n        if mix_cnt:\n            expect = True\n        else:\n            lo = max(0, x - even_cnt)\n            hi = min(odd_cnt, x)\n            expect = lo <= hi and (lo | 1) <= hi\n        if expect != brute:\n            ok = False\n            print(f\"对拍失败: n={n} a={a} x={x} 结论={expect} 暴力={brute}\")\n            break\n    print(f\"随机暴力对拍 400 组: {'✓' if ok else '✗'}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    if len(sys.argv) > 1 and sys.argv[1] == \"--test\":\n        run_tests()\n    else:\n        solve()","method":"solve","paramNames":[],"args":[],"stdin":"4\n4 2\n1 2 3 4\n4 2\n1 3 2 4\n4 2\n1 3 5 7\n1 1\n2","expected":"Yes\nYes\nNo\nNo","result":null,"events":[{"line":49,"locals":{},"depth":1},{"line":50,"locals":{"data":["4","4","2","1","2","3","4","4","2","1","3","2","4","4","2","1","3","5","7","1","1","2"]},"depth":1},{"line":51,"locals":{"data":["4","4","2","1","2","3","4","4","2","1","3","2","4","4","2","1","3","5","7","1","1","2"],"pos":0},"depth":1},{"line":52,"locals":{"data":["4","4","2","1","2","3","4","4","2","1","3","2","4","4","2","1","3","5","7","1","1","2"],"pos":0,"t":4},"depth":1},{"line":53,"locals":{"data":["4","4","2","1","2","3","4","4","2","1","3","2","4","4","2","1","3","5","7","1","1","2"],"pos":1,"t":4},"depth":1},{"line":54,"locals":{"data":["4","4","2","1","2","3","4","4","2","1","3","2","4","4","2","1","3","5","7","1","1","2"],"pos":1,"t":4,"out":[]},"depth":1},